      "layoutTips": [
        {
          "text": "All hallways on both floors cannot be chosen as a favourite room, meaning Ghost Orbs do not need to be checked for in these hallways. The Lobby can be chosen as a favourite room, however.",
          "subItems": []
        },
        {
          "text": "The four Science Classrooms at the back of the building (two downstairs and two upstairs) each consist of two smaller sub-rooms: the classroom with chairs and the science lab with large metal tables.",
          "subItems": []
        },
        {
          "text": "There are four pairs of bathrooms on the map, with one pair per side per floor:",
          "subItems": [
            "All male bathrooms are on the left, and all female bathrooms are on the right.",
            "Each pair consists of a student's bathroom (labelled boys/girls) and a teacher's bathroom (labelled male/female). The teacher's bathroom is behind the \"regular\" bathroom (when looking towards the back).",
            "The bathrooms are additionally labelled \"upstairs\" or \"downstairs\" respectively."
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Classrooms numbered 20 and above are all located on the 2nd floor. The rest, classrooms 1-19, are downstairs.",
          "subItems": []
        },
        {
          "text": "The upstairs hallway is divided into three separate rooms by the game. The game calls each of these 6 hallway rooms a \"Corridor\" (rather than a \"Hallway\").",
          "subItems": []
        },
        {
          "text": "In addition to doors and windows, fingerprints can also appear on bathroom mirrors.",
          "subItems": []
        },
        {
          "text": "The following rooms count as dim rooms and hence will drain sanity with 80% of the rate, even with all room lights being on:",
          "subItems": [
            "Lobby, First Floor Main Corridor, First Floor Right Corridor, First Floor Left Corridor, Basketball Court, Lecture Hall, Second Floor Main Corridor, Second Floor Right Corridor, Second Floor Left Corridor."
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Classroom 10 has no main room lights and hence no means of sanity drain prevention (other than firelights).",
          "subItems": []
        }
      ],
